"author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RED characterization found a production defect: because Mode inherits str, functools.total_ordering preserves inherited str.__gt__, so bootstrap-throttle > reconcile-check is evaluated lexically and returns false. Created child bug 3c6a-4999-7466-46b1; the parent hierarchy records provenance because an explicit discovered_from link would be redundant. The test-only parent remains unchanged in scope; the child owns the production repair before these compatibility tests land.","timestamp":1786150554128037001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Compatibility characterization is GREEN after child 3c6a repairs the discovered rank-order defect. tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py pins the exact five-entry MODE_CAPS mapping. tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py writes and reads reconcile-check through the real ref backend, proves bootstrap-throttle is blocked, and proves equal reconcile-check remains allowed. Combined focused suites pass 14/14; no production file is part of this ticket's commit.","timestamp":1786151386480795001}],"created_at":1786149627404913001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4fe1f14c-c991-42db-ae89-fd7d004dff30","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"64df-ec15-b6a2-4198"},{"link_uuid":"8db08105-08ae-49f9-a299-04caf1560125","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"6b6a-50ea-a031-4752"}],"description":"## Context\nCompletion verification for b42a found that the shipped Mode enum, MODE_CAPS mapping, and reconcile-check phase-gate value remain present, but the acceptance criterion over-attributed their direct coverage to test_mode.py and test_advisory_lock.py. The change is already merged; add focused characterization coverage without changing production behavior.\n\n## Approach\n- Extend the existing mode contract suite to pin the complete MODE_CAPS mapping, including RECONCILE_CHECK=0 and every legacy mode cap.\n- Extend the existing ref-backed advisory-lock phase-gate test to write and read the exact reconcile-check value and prove higher modes block while the equal reconcile-check target remains allowed.\n- Keep all old mode values, ordering, caps, and gate storage unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py directly asserts the complete MODE_CAPS mapping for all five legacy modes.\n- [ ] tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py round-trips gated_mode reconcile-check through the real ref backend and proves equal-versus-higher blocking behavior.\n- [ ] No production file changes.\n- [ ] Focused tests, make lint, and make typecheck pass.\n\n## Compatibility and rollback\nThis is additive characterization coverage only. Reverting the test commit restores the prior coverage level without changing runtime state.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode.py","reason":"Pin the exact five-entry legacy MODE_CAPS contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_advisory_lock.py","reason":"Characterize the real ref-backed reconcile-check phase-gate round trip and blocking boundary."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","b42a-ffc3-deeb-4491"],["relates_to","64df-ec15-b6a2-4198"],["relates_to","6b6a-50ea-a031-4752"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b42a-ffc3-deeb-4491","parent_status_uuid":"1533f102-e369-4bb3-81a8-c7237fbaf384","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["compatibility","tests","bridge"],"ticket_id":"2c87-80d5-755b-4026","ticket_type":"task","title":"Pin legacy reconciler mode-cap and phase-gate continuity","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["77e02dad